#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_metadata_function_transformer.py:docstring
#: of
#: chemotools.adaptation._metadata_function_transformer.MetadataFunctionTransformer:1
msgid "Apply a callable that consumes feature data and routed metadata."
msgstr ""
"特徴量データとルーティングされたメタデータを受け取る callable を適用します。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_metadata_function_transformer.py:docstring
#: of
#: chemotools.adaptation._metadata_function_transformer.MetadataFunctionTransformer:3
msgid ""
"This is useful when a preprocessing function requires per-sample or per-"
"batch auxiliary information (e.g. reference spectra, wavelength arrays) that "
"must be threaded through a scikit-learn ``Pipeline`` via the metadata-"
"routing API."
msgstr ""
"前処理関数がサンプル別またはバッチ別の補助情報（参照スペクトル、波長配列な"
"ど）を必要とし、その情報をメタデータルーティング API によって scikit-learn "
"の ``Pipeline`` に渡す必要がある場合に役立ちます。"

#: ../../source/methods/generated/chemotools.adaptation.MetadataFunctionTransformer.rst:0
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_metadata_function_transformer.py:docstring
#: of
#: chemotools.adaptation._metadata_function_transformer.MetadataFunctionTransformer:8
msgid ""
"Function applied during ``transform``. It must accept ``X`` as its first "
"positional argument and each requested metadata value as a keyword argument. "
"The function is responsible for returning a numeric, 2-D ``np.ndarray`` with "
"the same number of samples and features as ``X``. "
"Use :func:`chemotools.adaptation.validation.check_metadata_function` to "
"verify this contract on representative data."
msgstr ""
"``transform`` 時に適用する関数。最初の位置引数として ``X`` を受け取り、要求す"
"る各メタデータ値をキーワード引数として受け取る必要があります。この関数は、"
"``X`` と同じサンプル数および特徴量数を持つ数値の 2 次元 ``np.ndarray`` を返す"
"必要があります。代表データでこの規約を検証するに"
"は :func:`chemotools.adaptation.validation.check_metadata_function` を使用し"
"てください。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_metadata_function_transformer.py:docstring
#: of
#: chemotools.adaptation._metadata_function_transformer.MetadataFunctionTransformer:15
msgid ""
"Names of the keyword arguments requested through scikit-learn metadata "
"routing and forwarded to ``func``. Keys passed to ``transform`` but not "
"listed here are ignored. Every required keyword argument of ``func`` must be "
"listed, and the corresponding value must be supplied when calling "
"``transform``. The names ``\"X\"`` and ``\"y\"`` are reserved by the "
"estimator API and cannot be requested as metadata."
msgstr ""
"scikit-learn のメタデータルーティングを通じて要求し、``func`` に転送するキー"
"ワード引数の名前。``transform`` に渡されても、ここに記載されていないキーは無"
"視されます。``func`` の必須キーワード引数をすべて記載し、``transform`` の呼び"
"出し時に対応する値を指定する必要があります。名前 ``\"X\"`` と ``\"y\"`` は推"
"定器 API で予約されているため、メタデータとして要求できません。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_metadata_function_transformer.py:docstring
#: of
#: chemotools.adaptation._metadata_function_transformer.MetadataFunctionTransformer:22
msgid ""
"If ``True``, validate ``X`` as a numeric, 2-D array during ``fit`` and "
"``transform``, and require the number of features to remain consistent. This "
"does not validate the output of ``func``. If ``False``, pass ``X`` to "
"``func`` unchanged. In both cases, ``fit`` must be called before "
"``transform``."
msgstr ""
"``True`` の場合、``fit`` および ``transform`` 時に ``X`` を数値の 2 次元配列"
"として検証し、特徴量数が変わらないことを要求します。``func`` の出力は検証しま"
"せん。``False`` の場合、``X`` を変更せずに ``func`` へ渡します。どちらの場合"
"も、``transform`` より先に ``fit`` を呼び出す必要があります。"

#: ../../source/methods/generated/chemotools.adaptation.MetadataFunctionTransformer.rst:0
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "変数"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_metadata_function_transformer.py:docstring
#: of
#: chemotools.adaptation._metadata_function_transformer.MetadataFunctionTransformer:29
msgid ""
"Number of features seen during ``fit``.  Only set when ``validate=True``."
msgstr ""
"``fit`` 時に確認された特徴量数。``validate=True`` の場合にのみ設定されます。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_metadata_function_transformer.py:docstring
#: of
#: chemotools.adaptation._metadata_function_transformer.MetadataFunctionTransformer:35
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "使用例"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_metadata_function_transformer.py:docstring
#: of
#: chemotools.adaptation._metadata_function_transformer.MetadataFunctionTransformer:52
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "注記"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_metadata_function_transformer.py:docstring
#: of
#: chemotools.adaptation._metadata_function_transformer.MetadataFunctionTransformer:53
msgid ""
"To route metadata through a scikit-learn ``Pipeline``, enable metadata "
"routing globally with ``sklearn.set_config(enable_metadata_routing=True)``. "
"This is not required when calling this estimator directly."
msgstr ""
"scikit-learn の ``Pipeline`` を通じてメタデータをルーティングするには、"
"``sklearn.set_config(enable_metadata_routing=True)`` を使用してメタデータルー"
"ティングをグローバルに有効化します。この推定器を直接呼び出す場合は必要ありま"
"せん。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_metadata_function_transformer.py:docstring
#: of
#: chemotools.adaptation._metadata_function_transformer.MetadataFunctionTransformer:57
msgid ""
"The callable signature is validated during ``fit``, but the callable is "
"executed only during ``transform``. Consequently, errors that depend on "
"metadata values or callable execution are raised during ``transform``. "
"Use :func:`chemotools.adaptation.validation.check_metadata_function` to "
"validate a callable eagerly on representative inputs."
msgstr ""
"callable のシグネチャは ``fit`` 時に検証されますが、callable が実行されるの"
"は ``transform`` 時だけです。そのため、メタデータ値または callable の実行に依"
"存するエラーは ``transform`` 時に送出されます。代表入力を用いて callable を事"
"前に検証するに"
"は :func:`chemotools.adaptation.validation.check_metadata_function` を使用し"
"てください。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_metadata_function_transformer.py:docstring
#: of
#: chemotools.adaptation._metadata_function_transformer.MetadataFunctionTransformer:65
msgid ":py:obj:`chemotools.adaptation.validation.check_metadata_function`"
msgstr ":py:obj:`chemotools.adaptation.validation.check_metadata_function`"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_metadata_function_transformer.py:docstring
#: of
#: chemotools.adaptation._metadata_function_transformer.MetadataFunctionTransformer:66
msgid "Validate a custom metadata function on representative inputs."
msgstr "代表入力を用いてカスタムメタデータ関数を検証します。"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/_metadata_function_transformer.py:docstring
